# HPACK (RFC 7541) header decompression.
#
# Built in only, like keylog/ beside it: the decoder is reached by a direct
# call from whatever holds the connection state, so there is nothing for the
# module dispatcher to register and no DYN variant.
#
# huffman.h and static.h are generated from the RFC by rfc7541.py in this
# directory and are checked in, so building the tree needs neither python nor
# a copy of RFC 7541.
obj-$(CONFIG_CRYPTO_TRANSFORM_HPACK) += hpack.o
